          "passCondition": "only the previously active lifecycle resumes after fresh validation, with no stale OSD, hardware work or duplicate tap owner"
        }
      ],
      "disabledTap": "observe if naturally emitted; otherwise report unavailable and do not induce by synthetic input or an unsafe stall"
